      <article id="post-2" class="clearfix post-2 page type-page status-publish hentry">

<div class="page-builder-section section-page_hero  d-flex flex-column justify-content-center">
            <div class="bg">
            <video autoplay="" muted="" loop="" playsinline="" poster="/assets-f/img/f02e175735b2fd.jpg">
                <source src="/assets-f/media/f2d609f59805b6.mp4" type="video/mp4">
            </video>
        </div>
        <div class="container">
        <div class="text page-body">
            <h1>High Purity Water Solutions</h1>
<p>Fast and reliable deionized water tank exchange service with offsite regeneration, industrial RO systems, and high-purity water system maintenance for a wide range of industrial applications.</p>
<div class="h3">Reliable Pure Water Solutions That Won’t Let Your Business Down.</div>
                    </div>
            </div>
</div>
<div data-bg="/assets-f/img/0b2ee1c67d2c2a.jpg" class="page-builder-section section-homepage_services rocket-lazyload entered lazyloaded" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://puretecwater.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/1-1536x2048.jpg&quot;);" data-ll-status="entered">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="d-lg-flex justify-content-between align-items-start">
            <div class="block-text sticky-lg-top">
                                    <span class="bg img-bg d-lg-none">
                        <img width="1536" height="2048" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201536%202048'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="" class="img-fluid" data-lazy-src="/assets-f/img/0b2ee1c67d2c2a.jpg"><noscript><img width="1536" height="2048" src="/assets-f/img/0b2ee1c67d2c2a.jpg" alt="" class="img-fluid"></noscript>
                    </span>
                                <div class="text page-body" data-aos="fade-up">
                    <div class="h4"><span style="color: #0055a5;">Service you can count on</span></div>
<h2>Over 6,000 companies trust our ultra-pure industrial water solutions.</h2>
<p>Puretec provides water treatment solutions that transform incoming city water into highly purified deionized water suitable for hundreds of industrial applications across dozens of industries.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
                            <div class="blocks">
                                            <div class="item" data-aos="fade-up">
                            <div class="image">
                                <span class="img-bg">
                                    <img width="768" height="512" src="/assets-f/img/5c9d5bf720161b.jpg" alt="" class="img-fluid entered lazyloaded" data-lazy-src="/assets-f/img/5c9d5bf720161b.jpg" data-ll-status="loaded"><noscript><img width="768" height="512" src="/assets-f/img/5c9d5bf720161b.jpg" alt="" class="img-fluid"></noscript>
                                </span>
                                <span class="line" data-aos="height"><span></span></span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="text page-body">
                                <h3>Deionized Water on Demand</h3>
                                <p>Maintain consistent deionized (DI) water without any chemicals or wastewater output. Zero upfront capital cost, cancel anytime, and easily scalable for maximum flexibility. We provide fast next day delivery service and options for remote monitoring and auto-bank switching to make sure that you never run out of deionized water for your production needs.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                                            <div class="item" data-aos="fade-up">
                            <div class="image">
                                <span class="img-bg">
                                    <img width="768" height="512" src="/assets-f/img/c0209072d68bca.jpg" alt="" class="img-fluid entered lazyloaded" data-lazy-src="/assets-f/img/c0209072d68bca.jpg" data-ll-status="loaded"><noscript><img width="768" height="512" src="/assets-f/img/c0209072d68bca.jpg" alt="" class="img-fluid"></noscript>
                                </span>
                                <span class="line" data-aos="height"><span></span></span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="text page-body">
                                <h3>Next Day Delivery</h3>
                                <p>Next day delivery and same day emergency service is standard for all deionized tank deliveries and service calls within our standard delivery areas. We are built for speed because we know that you depend on us 24/7. It’s all part of the Puretec365<sup>TM</sup> promise.<br>
<img width="1440" height="810" decoding="async" src="/assets-f/img/e942c239646928.png" alt="Puretec365 logo" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto;" data-lazy-src="/assets-f/img/e942c239646928.png" data-ll-status="loaded" class="entered lazyloaded"><noscript><img width="1440" height="810" decoding="async" src="/assets-f/img/e942c239646928.png" alt="Puretec365 logo" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto;"/></noscript></p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                                            <div class="item" data-aos="fade-up">
                            <div class="image">
                                <span class="img-bg">
                                    <img width="768" height="512" src="/assets-f/img/1c45588e56f899.jpg" alt="" class="img-fluid entered lazyloaded" data-lazy-src="/assets-f/img/1c45588e56f899.jpg" data-ll-status="loaded"><noscript><img width="768" height="512" src="/assets-f/img/1c45588e56f899.jpg" alt="" class="img-fluid"></noscript>
                                </span>
                                <span class="line" data-aos="height"><span></span></span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="text page-body">
                                <h3>Cancel Anytime</h3>
                                <p>Our promise to you is that if we do not provide the DI delivery service that you expect, then you can cancel at any time. You deserve the freedom to leave a vendor if they are not able to deliver!</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                                            <div class="item" data-aos="fade-up">
                            <div class="image">
                                <span class="img-bg">
                                    <img width="768" height="510" src="/assets-f/img/59d7a797257059.jpg" alt="" class="img-fluid entered lazyloaded" data-lazy-src="/assets-f/img/59d7a797257059.jpg" data-ll-status="loaded"><noscript><img width="768" height="510" src="/assets-f/img/59d7a797257059.jpg" alt="" class="img-fluid"></noscript>
                                </span>
                                <span class="line" data-aos="height"><span></span></span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="text page-body">
                                <h3>Comprehensive High-Purity Water Solutions</h3>
                                <p>If you require ultra-pure deionized water for use as a rinse, ingredient, or thermal transfer at your facility, then we can install and maintain the right system for you. If for some reason we can’t help you, then we’ll help you find someone who can.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                                    </div>
                    </div>
    </div>
</div><div data-wpr-lazyrender="1" class="page-builder-section section-industries_overview">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row align-items-center">
            <div class="col-12 col-lg-4">
                <div class="block-text page-body">
                    <h2>Industries We Serve</h2>
                                            <a href="#" target="" class="button">View All</a>
                                    </div>
            </div>
                            <div class="col-12 col-lg-8">
                    <div class="industries-list">
                        <div class="swiper">
                            <div class="swiper-wrapper">
                                                                    <div class="swiper-slide">
                                        <div class="item flex-grow-1">
  <div class="image">
    <span class="img-bg"><img fetchpriority="high" width="768" height="512" src="/assets-f/img/5bc5fca1e68b86.jpg" class="img-fluid wp-post-image entered lazyloaded" alt="Power lines at dusk." decoding="async" data-lazy-srcset="/assets-f/img/5bc5fca1e68b86.jpg 768w, /assets-f/img/70063441ff57d9.jpg 300w, /assets-f/img/079d5914b17550.jpg 1024w, /assets-f/img/005113b0be1011.jpg 1536w, /assets-f/img/defaaab16b2e3a.jpg 2048w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px" data-lazy-src="/assets-f/img/5bc5fca1e68b86.jpg" data-ll-status="loaded" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px" srcset="/assets-f/img/5bc5fca1e68b86.jpg 768w, /assets-f/img/70063441ff57d9.jpg 300w, /assets-f/img/079d5914b17550.jpg 1024w, /assets-f/img/005113b0be1011.jpg 1536w, /assets-f/img/defaaab16b2e3a.jpg 2048w"><noscript><img fetchpriority="high" width="768" height="512" src="/assets-f/img/5bc5fca1e68b86.jpg" class="img-fluid wp-post-image" alt="Power lines at dusk." decoding="async" srcset="/assets-f/img/5bc5fca1e68b86.jpg 768w, /assets-f/img/70063441ff57d9.jpg 300w, /assets-f/img/079d5914b17550.jpg 1024w, /assets-f/img/005113b0be1011.jpg 1536w, /assets-f/img/defaaab16b2e3a.jpg 2048w" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px" /></noscript></span>
  </div>
  <div class="text page-body">
      <h3>Power</h3>
  </div>
  <div class="item-excerpt page-body">
      <p>Water is critical to the operation of a power plant. Power plants require water of varying purity for boiler feed, for cooling tower make-up and other plant needs.</p>
      <a href="#" class="button-arrow">Learn More</a>
  </div>
</div>                                    </div>
                                                                    <div class="swiper-slide">
                                        <div class="item flex-grow-1">
  <div class="image">
    <span class="img-bg"><img width="768" height="512" src="/assets-f/img/d908680533b5cd.jpg" class="img-fluid wp-post-image entered lazyloaded" alt="" decoding="async" data-lazy-srcset="/assets-f/img/d908680533b5cd.jpg 768w, /assets-f/img/6e3ebd442db8ca.jpg 300w, /assets-f/img/b7c8278cc1de0f.jpg 1024w, /assets-f/img/68618df99e2a07.jpg 1536w, /assets-f/img/23a4b0fd7a65cb.jpg 2048w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px" data-lazy-src="/assets-f/img/d908680533b5cd.jpg" data-ll-status="loaded" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px" srcset="/assets-f/img/d908680533b5cd.jpg 768w, /assets-f/img/6e3ebd442db8ca.jpg 300w, /assets-f/img/b7c8278cc1de0f.jpg 1024w, /assets-f/img/68618df99e2a07.jpg 1536w, /assets-f/img/23a4b0fd7a65cb.jpg 2048w"><noscript><img width="768" height="512" src="/assets-f/img/d908680533b5cd.jpg" class="img-fluid wp-post-image" alt="" decoding="async" srcset="/assets-f/img/d908680533b5cd.jpg 768w, /assets-f/img/6e3ebd442db8ca.jpg 300w, /assets-f/img/b7c8278cc1de0f.jpg 1024w, /assets-f/img/68618df99e2a07.jpg 1536w, /assets-f/img/23a4b0fd7a65cb.jpg 2048w" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px" /></noscript></span>
  </div>
  <div class="text page-body">
      <h3>Solar Panels</h3>
  </div>
  <div class="item-excerpt page-body">
      <p>Elevating Solar Panel Performance with High Purity Water Solutions Puretec is your trusted partner in delivering high purity water solutions […]</p>
      <a href="#" class="button-arrow">Learn More</a>
  </div>
</div>                                    </div>
                                                                    <div class="swiper-slide">
                                        <div class="item flex-grow-1">
  <div class="image">
    <span class="img-bg"><img width="768" height="512" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20768%20512'%3E%3C/svg%3E" class="img-fluid wp-post-image" alt="Hydrocarbon and Chemical Processing plant with industrial water systems." decoding="async" data-lazy-srcset="/assets-f/img/ec3673abfae882.jpg 768w, /assets-f/img/f8f24ac8cba99f.jpg 300w, /assets-f/img/764d3636404f62.jpg 1024w, /assets-f/img/b234b223c3549c.jpg 1536w, /assets-f/img/dc82746ad6a04f.jpg 2048w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px" data-lazy-src="/assets-f/img/ec3673abfae882.jpg"><noscript><img width="768" height="512" src="/assets-f/img/ec3673abfae882.jpg" class="img-fluid wp-post-image" alt="Hydrocarbon and Chemical Processing plant with industrial water systems." decoding="async" srcset="/assets-f/img/ec3673abfae882.jpg 768w, /assets-f/img/f8f24ac8cba99f.jpg 300w, /assets-f/img/764d3636404f62.jpg 1024w, /assets-f/img/b234b223c3549c.jpg 1536w, /assets-f/img/dc82746ad6a04f.jpg 2048w" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px" /></noscript></span>
  </div>
  <div class="text page-body">
      <h3>Hydrocarbon and Chemical Processing</h3>
  </div>
  <div class="item-excerpt page-body">
      <p>Billions of gallons of water are consumed every day in Hydrocarbon and Chemical Processing. Whether used for steam production, raw product make-up, cooling water or utility needs, high quality clean water is critical to plant operation, uptime, and yield.</p>
      <a href="#" class="button-arrow">Learn More</a>
  </div>
</div>                                    </div>
                                                                    <div class="swiper-slide">
                                        <div class="item flex-grow-1">
  <div class="image">
    <span class="img-bg"><img width="768" height="513" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20768%20513'%3E%3C/svg%3E" class="img-fluid wp-post-image" alt="photograph of a beverage bottling plant" decoding="async" data-lazy-srcset="/assets-f/img/68720914a6583f.jpg 768w, /assets-f/img/7f148b2c0d69eb.jpg 300w, /assets-f/img/b5e0c7be37f497.jpg 1024w, /assets-f/img/6d293227e4f043.jpg 1536w, /assets-f/img/6ee9d6a1196f46.jpg 2048w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px" data-lazy-src="/assets-f/img/68720914a6583f.jpg"><noscript><img width="768" height="513" src="/assets-f/img/68720914a6583f.jpg" class="img-fluid wp-post-image" alt="photograph of a beverage bottling plant" decoding="async" srcset="/assets-f/img/68720914a6583f.jpg 768w, /assets-f/img/7f148b2c0d69eb.jpg 300w, /assets-f/img/b5e0c7be37f497.jpg 1024w, /assets-f/img/6d293227e4f043.jpg 1536w, /assets-f/img/6ee9d6a1196f46.jpg 2048w" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px" /></noscript></span>
  </div>
  <div class="text page-body">
      <h3>Food, Dairy and Beverage</h3>
  </div>
  <div class="item-excerpt page-body">
      <p>Without water there would be no food to eat, no beverages to drink. The Food and Beverage industry uses vast amounts of water as ingredient make-up to manufacture consistent, repeatable, safe products in a highly regulated environment. Water is also used for rinsing/cleaning, sanitization, and plant utility needs.</p>
      <a href="#" class="button-arrow">Learn More</a>
  </div>
</div>                                    </div>
                                                                    <div class="swiper-slide">
                                        <div class="item flex-grow-1">
  <div class="image">
    <span class="img-bg"><img width="768" height="587" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20768%20587'%3E%3C/svg%3E" class="img-fluid wp-post-image" alt="Pharmaceutical technician measuring dosages." decoding="async" data-lazy-srcset="/assets-f/img/409e7b0eba4294.jpg 768w, /assets-f/img/0af059b3d180f1.jpg 300w, /assets-f/img/100476ef50e25d.jpg 1024w, /assets-f/img/a39460ffe19b93.jpg 1536w, /assets-f/img/2a95dcf76d5307.jpg 2048w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px" data-lazy-src="/assets-f/img/409e7b0eba4294.jpg"><noscript><img width="768" height="587" src="/assets-f/img/409e7b0eba4294.jpg" class="img-fluid wp-post-image" alt="Pharmaceutical technician measuring dosages." decoding="async" srcset="/assets-f/img/409e7b0eba4294.jpg 768w, /assets-f/img/0af059b3d180f1.jpg 300w, /assets-f/img/100476ef50e25d.jpg 1024w, /assets-f/img/a39460ffe19b93.jpg 1536w, /assets-f/img/2a95dcf76d5307.jpg 2048w" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px" /></noscript></span>
  </div>
  <div class="text page-body">
      <h3>Pharmaceutical / Biotech</h3>
  </div>
  <div class="item-excerpt page-body">
      <p>Water is a critical component of the pharmaceutical manufacturing process. High quality purified water is required for ingredient processing, device manufacturing, water for injection, laboratory use and general utility needs.</p>
      <a href="#" class="button-arrow">Learn More</a>
  </div>
</div>                                    </div>
                                                                    <div class="swiper-slide">
                                        <div class="item flex-grow-1">
  <div class="image">
    <span class="img-bg"><img width="768" height="512" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20768%20512'%3E%3C/svg%3E" class="img-fluid wp-post-image" alt="Technician examining microelectronics." decoding="async" data-lazy-srcset="/assets-f/img/04b7d7af3b0c77.jpg 768w, /assets-f/img/555a75f0f16465.jpg 300w, /assets-f/img/31292d17a5ae20.jpg 1024w, /assets-f/img/55ce053f37283a.jpg 1536w, /assets-f/img/cc717224e808b3.jpg 2048w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px" data-lazy-src="/assets-f/img/04b7d7af3b0c77.jpg"><noscript><img width="768" height="512" src="/assets-f/img/04b7d7af3b0c77.jpg" class="img-fluid wp-post-image" alt="Technician examining microelectronics." decoding="async" srcset="/assets-f/img/04b7d7af3b0c77.jpg 768w, /assets-f/img/555a75f0f16465.jpg 300w, /assets-f/img/31292d17a5ae20.jpg 1024w, /assets-f/img/55ce053f37283a.jpg 1536w, /assets-f/img/cc717224e808b3.jpg 2048w" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px" /></noscript></span>
  </div>
  <div class="text page-body">
      <h3>Microelectronics</h3>
  </div>
  <div class="item-excerpt page-body">
      <p>Microelectronics is an ever-evolving industry and ultrapure water (UPW) is critical to achieve the yields required to meet the market demands for complex computers, sophisticated military weaponry and everyday products such as televisions and cell phones. 24/7/365 manufacturing is standard, and downtime is unacceptable.</p>
      <a href="#" class="button-arrow">Learn More</a>
  </div>
</div>                                    </div>
                                                                    <div class="swiper-slide">
                                        <div class="item flex-grow-1">
  <div class="image">
    <span class="img-bg"><img width="768" height="718" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20768%20718'%3E%3C/svg%3E" class="img-fluid wp-post-image" alt="Engineer examining vehicle in a manufacturing setting." decoding="async" data-lazy-srcset="/assets-f/img/e85940df97d025.jpg 768w, /assets-f/img/0df2d6ee6a2302.jpg 300w, /assets-f/img/e84584588b2a30.jpg 1024w, /assets-f/img/08b6445587dc0f.jpg 1232w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px" data-lazy-src="/assets-f/img/e85940df97d025.jpg"><noscript><img width="768" height="718" src="/assets-f/img/e85940df97d025.jpg" class="img-fluid wp-post-image" alt="Engineer examining vehicle in a manufacturing setting." decoding="async" srcset="/assets-f/img/e85940df97d025.jpg 768w, /assets-f/img/0df2d6ee6a2302.jpg 300w, /assets-f/img/e84584588b2a30.jpg 1024w, /assets-f/img/08b6445587dc0f.jpg 1232w" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px" /></noscript></span>
  </div>
  <div class="text page-body">
      <h3>General Manufacturing</h3>
  </div>
  <div class="item-excerpt page-body">
      <p>From rinsing and washing of components to cooling of processes to use as a dilution medium in product make-up and for utility use, water is an important component of many general manufacturing processes.</p>
      <a href="#" class="button-arrow">Learn More</a>
  </div>
</div>                                    </div>
                                                                    <div class="swiper-slide">
                                        <div class="item flex-grow-1">
  <div class="image">
    <span class="img-bg"><img width="768" height="432" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20768%20432'%3E%3C/svg%3E" class="img-fluid wp-post-image" alt="Products that use highly specialized ingredient water." decoding="async" data-lazy-srcset="/assets-f/img/dc47f4ed600537.jpg 768w, /assets-f/img/8a95173047ec39.jpg 300w, /assets-f/img/346bf02607e2f7.jpg 1024w, /assets-f/img/8118053d432483.jpg 1536w, /assets-f/img/d9f71ac0985106.jpg 2048w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px" data-lazy-src="/assets-f/img/dc47f4ed600537.jpg"><noscript><img width="768" height="432" src="/assets-f/img/dc47f4ed600537.jpg" class="img-fluid wp-post-image" alt="Products that use highly specialized ingredient water." decoding="async" srcset="/assets-f/img/dc47f4ed600537.jpg 768w, /assets-f/img/8a95173047ec39.jpg 300w, /assets-f/img/346bf02607e2f7.jpg 1024w, /assets-f/img/8118053d432483.jpg 1536w, /assets-f/img/d9f71ac0985106.jpg 2048w" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px" /></noscript></span>
  </div>
  <div class="text page-body">
      <h3>Ingredient Water</h3>
  </div>
  <div class="item-excerpt page-body">
      <p>Water is used as a diluting agent to manufacture many products.</p>
      <a href="#" class="button-arrow">Learn More</a>
  </div>
</div>                                    </div>
                                                                    <div class="swiper-slide">
                                        <div class="item flex-grow-1">
  <div class="image">
    <span class="img-bg"><img width="768" height="683" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20768%20683'%3E%3C/svg%3E" class="img-fluid wp-post-image" alt="Scientists monitoring agricultural project." decoding="async" data-lazy-srcset="/assets-f/img/5a7fb3f53db9f6.jpg 768w, /assets-f/img/d6af10f220580a.jpg 300w, /assets-f/img/8a7ff0d70ec76f.jpg 1024w, /assets-f/img/5133b5c9887034.jpg 1536w, /assets-f/img/ed9cb90d008d1a.jpg 2048w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px" data-lazy-src="/assets-f/img/5a7fb3f53db9f6.jpg"><noscript><img width="768" height="683" src="/assets-f/img/5a7fb3f53db9f6.jpg" class="img-fluid wp-post-image" alt="Scientists monitoring agricultural project." decoding="async" srcset="/assets-f/img/5a7fb3f53db9f6.jpg 768w, /assets-f/img/d6af10f220580a.jpg 300w, /assets-f/img/8a7ff0d70ec76f.jpg 1024w, /assets-f/img/5133b5c9887034.jpg 1536w, /assets-f/img/ed9cb90d008d1a.jpg 2048w" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px" /></noscript></span>
  </div>
  <div class="text page-body">
      <h3>Agriculture</h3>
  </div>
  <div class="item-excerpt page-body">
      <p>We all know that without water, we wouldn’t have food to sustain life. In agriculture, water is used to grow fruits, vegetables, cotton, tobacco, cannabis, and many other plant-based products.</p>
      <a href="#" class="button-arrow">Learn More</a>
  </div>
</div>                                    </div>
                                                            </div>
