                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                    </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page-builder-section section-testimonials">
    <div class="bg">
        <img width="1368" height="780" src="/assets-f/img/1c6495b6e8fa7e.jpg" alt="" class="img-fluid entered lazyloaded" data-lazy-src="/assets-f/img/1c6495b6e8fa7e.jpg" data-ll-status="loaded"><noscript><img width="1368" height="780" src="/assets-f/img/1c6495b6e8fa7e.jpg" alt="" class="img-fluid"></noscript>
    </div>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="swiper">
            <div class="swiper-wrapper">
                                    <div class="swiper-slide">
                        <blockquote class="page-body"><p>When an unexpected issue arose shortly after installation, Puretec’s team communicated clearly, acted quickly, and demonstrated a strong commitment to supporting their customer. That level of accountability and follow-through is rare.</p>
<p>They’ve proven they don’t just compete on cost — they compete on integrity and partnership. It’s clear they stand behind their work and prioritize long-term relationships.</p>
</blockquote>
                        <div class="h5">Texas Manufacturer</div>
                    </div>
                                    <div class="swiper-slide">
                        <blockquote class="page-body"><p>We had a problem with our RODI system and originally thought it was Puretec’s fault. Their management took accountably and focused on solving the issue. We later found out it was our fault for the system failure and I really respect Puretec for not playing the blame game and just focusing on solving the problem quickly.</p>
</blockquote>
                        <div class="h5">Arizona Semiconductor Fab</div>
                    </div>
                                    <div class="swiper-slide">
                        <blockquote class="page-body"><p>With Puretec, we have one less thing to worry about. They are fast, reliable, and I feel like they really care about us.</p>
</blockquote>
                        <div class="h5">Nevada Power Plant</div>
                    </div>
                                    <div class="swiper-slide">
                        <blockquote class="page-body"><p>We experienced 20 to 50% higher yield rates with Puretec’s mobile DI trailers compared to our previous provider. We also appreciate the standard design, remote monitoring and super friendly drivers who really take ownership and provide a white glove delivery and hookup.</p>
</blockquote>
                        <div class="h5">California Refinery</div>
                    </div>
                            </div>
            <div class="swiper-pagination"></div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
